ts in the Treasurer's Office.\nDuties\nTo collect all revenues for the County\nTo bill and collect all real estate and personal taxes in\nthe County\nRegister all motor vehicles with tax situs in the County\nTo issue driver licenses, C.D.L.'s, learner permits, I.D.\ncards, school permits, etc.\nTo disburse collections to the proper political subdivisions\nBoat Registration\nSnowmobile Registration\nInformational Materials Available\nC.D.L books\nDriver license books\nProvisional operator permits\nBoard books\nSpecialty license plate applications\nCopyright © 2012 MIPS Inc. All rights reserved. |\nDisclaimer\nOriginal text\nRate this translation\nYour feedback will be used to help improve Google Translate",
